+# 2026-08-25: first-class local (non-Docker) web install/run mode
+
+Added `lib/hive/local/` — a shared dependency-audit engine
+(`Hive::Local::DependencyAudit`) and daemon binary-consistency check with
+repair (`Hive::Local::DaemonDriftCheck`) — plus the `hive setup`
+orchestrator (`Hive::Commands::Setup`), hardened foreground `hive web` with
+a bind/auth policy gate (`Hive::Web::BindPolicy`, `--unsafe-bind`,
+port-in-use preflight), an optional managed web service lifecycle
+(`hive web install/start/stop/status/uninstall` over new `hive-web.service`
+/ `local.hive-web` templates, deliberately separate from the daemon unit),
+and a login-gated daemon-health page + repair action in the web UI
+(`/health/daemon`, `POST /health/daemon/repair`). Docker/hivebox behavior is
+unchanged (the container supervisor keeps its legacy warn-only 0.0.0.0
+posture). Docs: `docs/local-install.md`. See [[modules/local_setup]].
